 "file_title": "NOT gate (Hull–Zakharevich): A=T -> NOT A = F",
 "file_description": "Solved crease pattern (only the creases that fold) for A=T; the output wire NOT A carries FALSE. Flat-origami NOT gate from Hull & Zakharevich (arXiv:2309.07932), Figure 9. The horizontal pleats are the auxiliary pleat the gate needs."
